        "name": "Combat Assessment",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You make a telegraphed attack to learn about your foe. Make a melee Strike. On a hit, you can immediately attempt a check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Recall Knowledge] about the target. On a critical hit, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to the check to Recall Knowledge. The target is temporarily immune to Combat Assessment for 1 day.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "FlatModifier",
              "predicate": [
                "action:recall-knowledge",
                "critical-assessment"
              ],
              "selector": "skill-check",
              "slug": "combat-assessment",
              "type": "circumstance",
              "value": 2
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "commander",
              "fighter"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
